note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/arest-calc.om: arcalc (gpu/nvidia/om/apirest/calc.om), ops 0 to 13, as calc_parts() of
note CUDApp tests/api_rest_partitions.h and prefill() of tests/api_rest_diff.c call it. Q is its 32 q words; q
note after the call is output 128 on. Composed before arestg.om.
text t_name "AREST-CALC"
text t_calc "calc"
fn arop q view ulong 256 nq ulong ny ulong o edit ulong 256 to ulong
if or ne nq 32 not ckis 0 t_calc
ckbad
end
a = new ulong 32 0
for i ulong 32
put a i get q i
end
r = arcalc a
for i ulong 32
put o add 128 i get a i
end
ret r
end
